Z||000000||2M4 Dale||10-02-2000||12:49 AM||||Took my boys and played some paintball today...What a HOOT !!! We played in the woods with 2 seven man teams. I got basted pretty good in three out of the five games we played. But I did my share of marking too !!! I was useing a new Brass Eagle StingrayIce...Some of those guys had much more expensive guns...But you know my "cheapo" StingRay didn't break a single ball and they (guys with Tippmans) were having all kinds of trouble. I would have to say I got a good one...lol. Hec, I even took out the guy with the most expensive gun...it was some kind of autoloader. ||||reg||14
Z||000001||fiero56||10-02-2000||07:51 AM||||I played paintball for several years during high-school. But, it started getting expensive(well, always was, but I wanted money to buy my Fiero), so I sold my marker and acessories. Wish I hadn't, now everytime I go, I have to rent or borow. I've probably paid in rental fees what my I paid for my marker(Spyder).<P>I should get back into it, maybe one of the local places will have a sale soon. That's another one of my little "quirks", I refuse to buy stuff at full retail.||||reg||1
Z||000002||DJRice||10-02-2000||09:35 AM||||I have a Tippmann Pro-lite (although I havent played in several years) and I never had a big problem with breaking balls.  Its a good time no doubt.  <P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6<BR>"You mean like the back seat of a Volkswagen?"||||reg||1
Z||000003||btoth||10-02-2000||03:46 PM||||paintball has got to be one of the most exciting games that i have ever played.  my friends and i go quite often.  does cost a lot but it's worth it.  i would rather pay the money to play a great adrenaline pumping game like paintball than on other forms of entertainment.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  hey 2M4 Dale:  i just got a thing in the mail for a new field in Ohio called 'splatter park', their prices seem very good!  <A HREF="http://www.splatterpark.com" TARGET=_blank>www.splatterpark.com</A> ||||reg||10
Z||000004||pollock||10-03-2000||12:26 PM||||I played for the first time at a bachelor party a few weeks ago... not bad.<P>I was out, and standing in the "dead zone" and lifted my mask to wipe the sweat off.  The Ref, who was about a 15 year old punkass yelled at me, "Get yer mask on!!!" So i popped off to him a bit and we kinda got into it.  As he walked off, my buddy said he called me a **** , so i squeezed off about 4 rounds and drilled him right in the back, then acted like i didn't do it.  <P>Got kicked out, but we were done anyway, so it was worth it.  Had about 20 rounds left.  Should have just emptied on him.||||reg||1
Z||000005||pollock||10-03-2000||12:27 PM||||I played for the first time at a bachelor party a few weeks ago... not bad.<P>I was out, and standing in the "dead zone" and lifted my mask to wipe the sweat off.  The Ref, who was about a 15 year old punkass yelled at me, "Get yer mask on!!!" So i popped off to him a bit and we kinda got into it.  As he walked off, my buddy said he called me a c*ck, so i squeezed off about 4 rounds and drilled him right in the back, then acted like i didn't do it.  <P>Got kicked out, but we were done anyway, so it was worth it.  Had about 20 rounds left.  Should have just emptied on him.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Tigger||10-03-2000||01:03 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, lucidatypewriter">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by pollock:<BR><B>so i squeezed off about 4 rounds and drilled him right in the back, then acted like i didn't do it.  <P>Got kicked out, but we were done anyway, so it was worth it.  Had about 20 rounds left.  Should have just emptied on him.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>LOL, cracks me up, sounds like fun.  I'll have to try paintball sometime.<P>&lt;Runs and hides behind the "Pennock's Fiero Forum" billboard in the field&gt;<P><P>------------------<BR>T-T-F-N, Tah Tah For Now!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tigger.gif">          <BR> <A HREF="mailto:RacingStripes@hotmail.com">RacingStripes@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||7
Z||000007||fiero56||10-03-2000||03:14 PM||||If you're looking for an adrenaline rushing game of paintball. "Speedball" is the best, and my personal favorite. Basically you play in a roped off portion of field, with the only protection being plywood sheets you can barely fit behind. Gameplay is kinda' like capture the flag, very fun. ||||reg||1
