Z||000009||1FST2M6||10-03-2000||03:51 PM||||i've got a Tippman SL-68II and an Auto-mag. Ive played on and off for a while (7 years) at Arkenstone, owned by Ga. Paintball. some kids just got nailed a few weeks ago for shooting a pair of Auto-mags off an overpass at on comming cars.. (not to bright) they were 16-17 and are in juvy now till trial... for terristic threats and careless endangerment.. so just make sure your kids know not to mess with the cops and paintball guns!  and your neighbors will REALLY get mad if you paint thier dog..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  ooh.. i'll never forget that..  sorry.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   Action pursuit games is the big paintball mag around here. if you can find a VENTS, Predator (mask) buy it i'll send you money for it! they ROCK never fog and have SWEEET visibility! and can take a direct hit from 20' and not break!! ||||reg||1
Z||000010||SpeedPhreak||10-03-2000||06:27 PM||||i used to play.. had a team w/a partial sponsor (tourn fees, tourn paint & air).<BR>we mostly played tournaments that limited paint to 1 or 200 rounds per game.. or pump gun only.  i had a stock automag & a tracer 2 pump w/a smart parts barrel.  it was a lot of fun but w/school & work i didnt have the time to devote to serious practice & play all the time.<P>i think im going to get an airsoft gun.  the rifles are fully automatic & everything is cheaper.. equipment, ammo, dont have to buy air (except for the gas pistols).  plus they look like real guns & use clips.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.airsoft.org" TARGET=_blank>www.airsoft.org</A>  <A HREF="http://www.tasom.net" TARGET=_blank>www.tasom.net</A>  are 2 good sites.||||reg||1
Z||000011||LarryB||10-04-2000||11:43 AM||||I've played it a few times, it's a blast except when you've got a pump and your opponents have semis, the place we played at breaks up groups so that those with semis played each other apart from those with pumps, evens things out.<P>Only crappy part is the carbon dioxide from the gun attracting hordes of mosquitos. <BR>That and the welts you get from getting hit in the head in a spot not covered by your mask **OUCH**. ||||reg||6
Z||000012||SpeedPhreak||10-04-2000||01:13 PM||||larry- instead of separating the groups u should play pumps against semi's.  give each semi player only 50 rounds & u take a hundred.  it will help everyone learn tactics instead of how to paint a wall red... this is one reason our team always entered games that restricted paint.. it helps to emphasize team work & tactics instead of who has the fastest fire rate.||||reg||1
Z||000013||LarryB||10-04-2000||05:11 PM||||Hrm, not a bad idea.  If the guys with the semis went along with that it might just work.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
Z||000014||DJRice||10-04-2000||08:46 PM||||Speedball is da bomb....<P>Hehe, I had a guy rush me from behind and then took the time to scream "Call Dead" as he came out from behind the tree he rushed me from.  He figured that because I was in a bunker I would just go ahead and "Call Dead"  Wrong.  As soon as I saw him I capped him.  He was not happy.  He capped me back.  <P>hehe...<P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6<BR>"You mean like the back seat of a Volkswagen?"||||reg||1
Z||000015||2M4 Dale||10-04-2000||11:54 PM||||Semi-auto is definatly the way to go...we were whoopin' up on the pump guys...lol. ||||reg||14
Z||000016||RiceCooker||10-06-2000||02:16 PM||||I've done paintball afew times - What a hoot!<P>The first time I went with my hockey team at the end of the year and some parents came along (we were 16 or 17) My dad was there and he had played once before. Anyhow, the first game gets started and me and my two buddies were slowly creeping up the middle, just kinda figuring things out (it was so awesome). I guess my dad might have gone out of bounds or very far around us because before i knew it, my friend to the left of me went down, then on the right, and before i knew it, i had a stinging pain right in my a$$!!! it couldn't have been a better shot.<BR>Well i looked behind me about every ten seconds for the rest of the day and my dad talked about that for the next two years.  ||||reg||6
Z||000017||Spyro86SE||10-08-2000||03:27 PM||||got balllzzzz i play i used to have a tippman pro lite with a little bit of work i had it till it got stolen so i havent played in awhile but would love to go play again soon ||||reg||1
